  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcement of the Electricity Transmission Network in Kenya (RETNet)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to support Kenya&apos;s economic development by improving the reliability and efficiency of its electrical system and facilitating the penetration of renewable energies. The project includes the construction of a new National System Control Centre and of a new substation at Makindu, the completion of four substations around Nairobi, a capacity building program on operation/maintenance and system operation, and sectorial studies for the Ministry of Energy.</narrative>
  </description>
